=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {p:Walk of Echoes}
** {p:Veridical Conflux} at {z:Grauberg (S)} (F-5)
** or {p:Veridical Conflux} at {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} (J-9)
** or take the Survival Guide to {z:Batallia Downs} and click the ??? next to the maw to use your {k:Lightsworm} to enter.
* Select the **Ornate Door** up the stairs for a cutscene.
* Cait Sith asks you to find a remnant of latent energy. The latent energy points are found in the following locations:
** This quest is the same fight as the {q:previous|Champion of the Dawn|previous} quest except that you only need **__one**__ {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
** {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}, there is an unlabeled (blank) point of interest down the hill on the border of G-9 and H-9. Select it for the {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
** {z:East Ronfaure (S)}, northwest corner of H-7 by a tree alongside the river. Select it for the {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
** {z:Jugner Forest (S)}, the southeast corner of **Lake Mechieume** has it, (I-6), just east of the river at the mouth of the lake. Select it for the {@k} {k:Breath of dawn}.
*** Survival guide warp to {z:East Ronfaure (S)} then head east in Jugner Forest (S) is the fastest way.
* Take one of these three Key Items to {p:Walk of Echoes} through the {p:Veridical Conflux} at {z:Grauberg (S)} (F-5) or {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} (J-9) or using {k:Lightsworm} in {z:Batallia Downs}.
* Check the **Ornate Door** for a cut scene, and again to begin the fight.

=3 Champion of the Dawn
* You fight {p:Cait Sith}.
* The fight is trivial at 99. {p:Trusts} may be summoned.
* {p:Cait Sith} will use -ja spells and may put the party to sleep with **Mewing Lullaby** (as well as casting other enfeebling spells).
* Upon completion of the fight, the quest is complete, and you may select from the list of rewards.
** If you had previously chosen the option "For Lilisette to...", it does not appear again.
* Quest may be completed once per Earth day.

